cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this demonstrator, please cite it as below."
title: "Synthetic Multi-Cycle Tool-Wear Simulation Framework"
abstract: >-
  A solver-free Python demonstrator of an automated, cycle-by-cycle tool-wear
  loop for 2D orthogonal cutting: synthetic process fields, a Usui-type wear law,
  node-based geometry update, interior mesh smoothing and mesh-quality control.
  All inputs and outputs are synthetic; the project is not experimentally validated.
type: software
authors:
